{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13625","headline":"送崔峒使往睦州兼寄薛司户 · 严维","name":"送崔峒使往睦州兼寄薛司户","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如今相府用英髦，独往南州肯告劳。\n冰水近开渔浦出，雪云初卷定山高。\n木奴花映桐庐县，青雀舟随白露涛。\n使者应须访廉吏，府中惟有范功曹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}